WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.177
 I hear you've built
the perfect safe house.

00:00:02.177 --> 00:00:03.210
Well, what's this even made of?

00:00:03.210 --> 00:00:04.367
Vibranium?

00:00:04.367 --> 00:00:05.858
[CRASH]

00:00:09.834 --> 00:00:13.313
[TRIUMPHANT MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:19.277 --> 00:00:22.259
[BOLLYWOOD MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:38.660 --> 00:00:41.860
 An eerie stillness
chokes our lungs.

00:00:41.860 --> 00:00:42.660
 What are you doing?

00:00:42.660 --> 00:00:43.890
You know you are
creeping us out.

00:00:43.890 --> 00:00:44.790
You know that, right?
[BANG]

00:00:44.790 --> 00:00:45.930
Oh, God.

00:00:45.930 --> 00:00:46.800
Stay calm, please!

00:00:51.660 --> 00:00:52.650
Chips.

00:00:52.650 --> 00:00:53.450
It was just chips.

00:00:58.290 --> 00:00:59.850
 Thought you'd given up on humans.

00:00:59.850 --> 00:01:02.160
 I have a family now.

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:05.430
They give me faith again.

00:01:05.430 --> 00:01:09.165
And I see the good in humanity
in them every single day.

00:01:27.600 --> 00:01:29.650
 These steam--

00:01:29.650 --> 00:01:30.450
 Engine.

00:01:30.450 --> 00:01:32.260
 I am sure you have
something simpler.

00:01:32.260 --> 00:01:33.060
 Simple.

00:01:33.060 --> 00:01:37.395
Let's see-- ladies and
gentlemen, the plow.

00:01:42.490 --> 00:01:55.415
 [SPEAKING ANCIENT BABYLONIAN]

00:01:55.415 --> 00:01:56.900
[CHEERING]

00:02:14.240 --> 00:02:18.710
 [SPEAKING HINDI]
I'm Karan Patel.

00:02:18.710 --> 00:02:22.700
Kingo's valet. It's truly an
honor to be in the presence

00:02:22.700 --> 00:02:23.985
of the great Eternals.

00:02:29.040 --> 00:02:33.660
 So, how did you end up
scoring this emerald tablet,

00:02:33.660 --> 00:02:35.635
my beautiful, beautiful Makkari?

00:02:39.756 --> 00:02:42.170
Did you miss me?

00:02:42.170 --> 00:02:43.280
 I'm sorry, what
are we watching

00:02:43.280 --> 00:02:44.480
because-- are you two--

00:02:44.480 --> 00:02:46.070
 Is this new, because I hate it.

00:02:50.130 --> 00:02:52.760
 Who do you think is
going to lead the Avengers?

00:02:52.760 --> 00:02:53.850
 I could lead them.

00:02:53.850 --> 00:02:56.330
 Thor used to follow me around
when he was a little kid.

00:02:56.330 --> 00:02:58.760
Now he's a famous Avenger
and won't return my calls.

00:03:02.660 --> 00:03:06.010
[TRIUMPHANT MUSIC PLAYING]

